OL,3,GNEWSAMan dead after fire in block of
OL,4,Aflats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after a fire on the
OL,7,Ffirst floor of a three-storey block of
OL,8,Fflats.
OL,10,FBuckinghamshire Fire & Rescue Service
OL,11,Fsaid eight crews and five officers
OL,12,Fattended the blaze at Hughenden
OL,13,FBoulevard, High Wycombe, after being
OL,14,Fcalled at 00:14 BST on Sunday.
OL,16,FCrews used breathing apparatus and gas
OL,17,Fmonitors to check carbon monoxide
OL,18,Flevels within the block of flats as
OL,19,Fthey tackled the fire. One man was
OL,20,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
