OL,4,Aflats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fire service scaled back operations
OL,7,Fat about 01:30, and the scene was
OL,8,Fhanded over to Thames Valley Police,
OL,9,Fwho will complete a file for the
OL,10,Fcoroner.
